  "reason": "With no prior experiments, there is maximum uncertainty across all design dimensions (modality, profile type, encoders, aggregation, fusion). Config_001 represents the most complete and expressive multimodal setup: it combines both modalities (multimodal), uses multiprofile for richer cellular representation, a robust standard RNA encoder (PCA n2000), a strong pretrained image encoder (ViT-L), an expressive aggregation mechanism (transformer), and flexible weighted fusion. Starting here establishes a strong upper-bound reference: if it performs well, subsequent experiments can ablate individual components to identify what drives accuracy; if it underperforms, we learn that the full pipeline is over-parameterized or a specific component is harmful. This single experiment simultaneously informs decisions about modality, profile strategy, encoder choice, and fusion strategy, making it the highest-information-gain first test under a tight 10-experiment budget."
